quired checks pass: `uv run pytest -q tests/test_metagame_topdeck.py` (5 passed) and `uv run ruff check .` (clean). I didn't run the full test suite, the web checks or the real-log verification from AGENTS.md. I also didn't run the privacy scan.\n\nThe changes, as the spec describes them:\n- **Regex:** `_NOT_CONSTRUCTED_RE` sits after `MAX_AGE_SECONDS`.\n- **Skip on fetch:** a matching tournament logs a warning and counts toward `skipped`.\n- **Purge:** `_purge_not_constructed(conn)` runs right after `store_events`. It deletes the matching events in one transaction and logs one warning with the count. It does nothing when none match.\n\nI didn't commit anything.", "ttft_ms": 2000, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 18633, "uuid": "26a203e3-7564-40f2-b012-64c7f5625c22", "ttft_stream_ms": 1202, "time_to_request_ms": 56, "first_content_frame_ms": 1202, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
